'''Dwight Vinson McDonald''' (born May 24, 1951) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[wide receiver]] in the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played for the [[San Diego Chargers]] from 1975 to 1978. He played [[college football]] at [[United States International Gulls football|United States International Gulls football]] and [[San Diego State Aztecs football|San Diego State Aztecs]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/M/McDoDw00.htm|title = Dwight McDonald Stats|website = [[Pro-Football-Reference.com]]}}</ref>
